               PERFORM CHECK-BROKER-ID-0002.
               PERFORM REFRESH-POSTCODE-0004.
               PERFORM FORMAT-SUM-ASSURED-0005.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-EXCESS-0006.
               PERFORM SEND-RECEIVE-MAP-0007.
               PERFORM CHECK-MODEL-0008.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-MODEL-0009.
               PERFORM DERIVE-AGENT-CODE-0010.
               PERFORM VALIDATE-NCD-YEARS-0011.
               PERFORM NORMALISE-ROOF-TYPE-0012.
               EXEC CICS RETURN END-EXEC.
